(text "R1/R2 are DNP if module pull-ups already exist.\nI2C pull-ups go to selected V3V3, never 5V." (at 245 254 0) (effects (font (size 1.05 1.05) ) (justify left top) ) (uuid fdec3baf-76b9-5b74-b3c0-2915267f4334))
(text "Both copper layers use GND pours with thermals and stitching vias. Keep controller and modules powered together; signal isolation is not provided." (at 15 271 0) (effects (font (size 1 1) ) (justify left top) ) (uuid bdeb62e9-c232-5b23-b493-6495f3214b27))
(text "All carrier interfaces use 3.3V logic. Confirm breakout voltages, physical connector order, purchased-part pinouts and current budget before fabrication." (at 15 277 0) (effects (font (size 1 1) ) (justify left top) ) (uuid ff01d75f-1b0c-58f5-b483-3de63c10515c))
